    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερᾰμ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, ἡ</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Diph.
			84
		</span></i>, 
			Ion.
		 and later -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖδος</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Emp.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Arist.
			<u>EE</u>
			1235a12
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>MM</u>
			1208b11
		</span></i>, cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			2.18
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέραμος</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roof-tile</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				206
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				366.21
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ.
				ἀγελαῖαι</span> common <i>tiles,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1672.209
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κορίνθιαι</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				71
			</span></i>; collectively, <i>tiling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				246a27
			</span></i>, cf. ll.cc.; prop. of clay, but also of marble, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1666<i>B</i>21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἀργυραῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.27.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. μολυβῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					14.621a
				</span></i>
			, cf. Moschioib.<i><span class="en">
				5.207a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράμιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1177.158
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PIand.</u>
				12.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii/iv A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ κ.</span>
			<i>potter's</i> earth, clay, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				111c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				844b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ γαῖα κεραμί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					43
				</span></i>
			.</div>
